# Icons Directory

This directory is reserved for icon assets for the SpecX AI Landing Page.

## Recommended Icon Format

- SVG (Scalable Vector Graphics) - preferred
- PNG with transparent background
- Icon sizes: 16x16, 32x32, 64x64, 128x128

## Icon Libraries (for future reference)

- Font Awesome
- Material Icons
- Heroicons
- Feather Icons
- Bootstrap Icons

## Current Implementation

The landing page currently uses emoji/text-based icons to avoid external dependencies.
Replace with proper icons when transitioning to production.
